<section class="csx-story" id="story-1">
  <div class="container csx-story-in">
    <aside class="csx-media">
      <div class="csx-media-in">
        <span class="csx-num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <div class="csx-chips"><span class="csx-tag">Client story</span><span class="csx-pkg csx-pkg--platinum">Platinum Bespoke</span></div>
        <div class="csx-media-foot">
          <p class="csx-svc">Service: <a href="/platinum-bespoke/">Platinum Bespoke</a></p>
          <p class="csx-priv">Client identity withheld at their request.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
    <div class="csx-main">
          <h3>Finding a smaller home and relocating, with the children living abroad</h3>
          <div class="csx-rows">
          <div class="csx-row"><b>Situation</b><p>Henry and Sofia were getting older and living in a large house that had become more than they needed. Their children had moved to another country, so there was no family nearby to help with a move.</p></div>
          <div class="csx-row"><b>What they needed</b><p>Help with the whole move, starting with finding a smaller, more manageable home.</p></div>
          <div class="csx-row"><b>How Chayce helped</b><p>They contacted Chayce, which helped them find a smaller home and then coordinated the full relocation under the Platinum Bespoke package.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="csx-outcome"><b>Outcome</b><p>After the move, the couple were happy in their new home and wanted to stay.</p></div>
        </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="csx-story csx-story--alt" id="story-2">
  <div class="container csx-story-in">
    <aside class="csx-media">
      <div class="csx-media-in">
        <span class="csx-num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <div class="csx-chips"><span class="csx-tag">Client story</span><span class="csx-pkg csx-pkg--bronze">Bronze Essentials</span></div>
        <div class="csx-media-foot">
          <p class="csx-svc">Service: <a href="/bronze-essentials/">Bronze Essentials</a></p>
          <p class="csx-priv">Client identity withheld at their request.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
    <div class="csx-main">
          <h3>Packing, removals and cleaning once the sale was done</h3>
          <div class="csx-rows">
          <div class="csx-row"><b>Situation</b><p>Margaret had already sold her home and secured her new property, but the thought of packing, coordinating removals and leaving the house clean was becoming overwhelming.</p></div>
          <div class="csx-row"><b>What she needed</b><p>She did not need someone to manage the sale or find her a property. She wanted the physical move handled properly.</p></div>
          <div class="csx-row"><b>How Chayce helped</b><p>Chayce organised the packing, removals and cleaning, taking the physical workload away and leaving her free to focus on the move itself.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="csx-outcome"><b>Outcome</b><p>Margaret could move into her new home without spending weeks dealing with boxes, lifting furniture or coordinating several different providers.</p></div>
        </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="csx-story" id="story-3">
  <div class="container csx-story-in">
