          <p class="csx-priv">Client identity withheld at their request.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
    <div class="csx-main">
          <h3>Downsizing from a home of more than 30 years</h3>
          <div class="csx-rows">
          <div class="csx-row"><b>Situation</b><p>David and Anne were downsizing from the family home they had lived in for more than 30 years. They had already decided where they were moving, but the number of things that needed organising quickly became too much.</p></div>
          <div class="csx-row"><b>What they needed</b><p>Someone to take responsibility for the moving process rather than simply provide a removal van.</p></div>
          <div class="csx-row"><b>How Chayce helped</b><p>Their coordinator managed the packing, removals, cleaning, utility transfers and the practical details around moving day.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="csx-outcome"><b>Outcome</b><p>Instead of coordinating several companies themselves, they had one person overseeing the move from preparation through to arrival.</p></div>
        </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="csx-story csx-story--alt" id="story-4">
  <div class="container csx-story-in">
    <aside class="csx-media">
      <div class="csx-media-in">
        <span class="csx-num" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
        <div class="csx-chips"><span class="csx-tag">Client story</span><span class="csx-pkg csx-pkg--platinum">Platinum Bespoke</span></div>
        <div class="csx-media-foot">
          <p class="csx-svc">Service: <a href="/platinum-bespoke/">Platinum Bespoke</a></p>
          <p class="csx-priv">Client identity withheld at their request.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
    <div class="csx-main">
          <h3>A family arranging a long-established home move with full support</h3>
          <div class="csx-rows">
          <div class="csx-row"><b>Situation</b><p>Robert&rsquo;s family wanted to make his move as easy as possible. He was leaving a long-established family home, had a large amount of belongings to sort through and needed considerable support before, during and after the move.</p></div>
          <div class="csx-row"><b>What the family needed</b><p>They were not looking for individual services. They wanted one team to coordinate the entire transition.</p></div>
          <div class="csx-row"><b>How Chayce helped</b><p>Chayce created a bespoke plan covering preparation of the home, sorting, packing, relocation, cleaning, setup and ongoing support after the move.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="csx-outcome"><b>Outcome</b><p>The family had a single team coordinating the transition, while Robert could focus on settling into his new home rather than managing the logistics.</p></div>
        </div>
  </div>
