<section class="csx-band csx-band--dark" id="feedback">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="csx-sec-head csx-sec-head--left"><span class="csx-eyebrow">Client feedback</span><h2>In their own words</h2><p>Comments shared with permission.</p></div>
    <div class="csx-quotes">
      <figure class="csx-q">
        <p class="csx-pull">That made the whole process feel much more manageable.</p>
        <div class="csx-qbody">
          <blockquote><p>&ldquo;We had lived in the same house for more than three decades, so the thought of deciding what came with us was much harder than we expected. It wasn't really about packing boxes &mdash; it was deciding what to keep, what to pass on and what we could finally let go of. Chayce helped us create a realistic plan around the move, rather than trying to do everything at once. That made the whole process feel much more manageable.&rdquo;</p></blockquote>
          <figcaption>Silver Comfort clients &middot; <a href="/silver-comfort/">Silver Comfort</a></figcaption>
        </div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="csx-q">
        <p class="csx-pull">For the first time, everyone knew what was happening and when.</p>
        <div class="csx-qbody">
          <blockquote><p>&ldquo;My brother and I live in different parts of the country, while Mum was still living alone in the family home. We knew a move would eventually make sense, but coordinating everything from a distance felt impossible. Chayce helped us break the process into manageable stages, from preparing the house to planning the move itself. For the first time, everyone knew what was happening and when.&rdquo;</p></blockquote>
          <figcaption>A Gold Prestige family &middot; <a href="/gold-prestige/">Gold Prestige</a></figcaption>
        </div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="csx-q">
        <p class="csx-pull">Rather than rushing into a decision, we came away with a clearer picture of what the next chapter could look like.</p>
        <div class="csx-qbody">
          <blockquote><p>&ldquo;After so many years in the same house, we knew the next move would be different, but we hadn't worked out exactly what we wanted from it. We used our consultation to talk through the type of home we were looking for, what we actually used in our current house and what the move would involve. Rather than rushing into a decision, we came away with a clearer picture of what the next chapter could look like.&rdquo;</p></blockquote>
          <figcaption>A Discovery client &middot; <a href="/discovery/">Discovery Consultation</a></figcaption>
        </div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

